# Penumbra

A PHP reporting platform: authors write SQL-backed reports, readers view/filter/pivot/export
them, and a scheduler emails or exports them on a cron. Reports can also be snapshotted,
journaled, dashboarded and shared by link.

This file is **orientation + operations runbook**. It exists because until 2026-08-18 the
operational knowledge of this system lived only in the author's head and in code comments,
which is fine right up until the moment it isn't. Keep it in the tree so it travels with the
code and can be grepped at 2am.

`.md` files are not served by IIS (no MIME mapping -> 404.3), so this is not web-readable.
**Do not put credentials in it anyway** - name where a secret lives, never its value.

Last substantively updated: 2026-09-12.

